 "transcription": {
  "from": "the files of the data set, downloaded from Zenodo (record 5115540) and copied by program, numbers unchanged (6 significant figures)",
  "checked_against_source": true,
  "note": "These are the authors' own GEMS calculations with the default Cemdata18 (no hemicarbonate solid solution: the 'noSSol' files), the solid lines of Figs. 4a and 7a of Georget et al. (2022); the scripts named in source.location draw those figures from these files, which identifies them. The files carry no units: the phase columns are masses in g for the system of 10 g of synthesized C3A (the scripts divide them by 10 to plot 'mass solid/mass C3A'); the concentrations are in mol/kg in McHc_new_noSSol.csv (Ca 0.0155 to 0.0180, against the paper's 'Ca 16.3 mmol/kg') and in mmol/kg in MsHc_new_noSSol.csv (Ca 16.3 to 16.5), units inferred from those magnitudes. Columns zeta_CO3 and eta_SO4 are not in the files: they are computed here with the formulas of the authors' scripts. The GEMS project itself (data/GEMs_project/AFmHcSSNa.zip, which fixes the water, the Na and the C3A of the calculation) is not transcribed."
 },
